  "description": "Celebrate the charm of autumn with the Weathered Patchwork Oktoberfest Digital Paper Pack, a cozy collection of 20 high-resolution JPG designs inspired by vintage Bavarian style. Each digital paper features rustic textures, heart motifs, pretzels, mugs, and gingham patterns in warm tones of blue, red, cream, and golden brown. The distressed finish gives each design a nostalgic, handcrafted feel — perfect for fall crafts, farmhouse décor, Oktoberfest invitations, digital scrapbooking, rustic party designs, sublimation, and cozy autumn projects. These versatile backgrounds bring a touch of warmth and tradition to every creative idea. Add old-world charm and weathered beauty to your seasonal crafts with this festive patchwork paper pack.\nProduct Details:\n• 20 JPG digital papers\n• Size: 4096 x 4096 px (High Resolution)\n• Format: JPG (non-transparent)\n• Theme: Rustic, Oktoberfest, farmhouse, fall patchwork\n• Works with Canva, Photoshop & Cricut\n• Instant download\n• Personal & commercial use\n• Designed for Creative Fabrica marketplace",
